 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 13263,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"8111\" data-start=\"7758\"><strong data-end=\"7771\" data-start=\"7760\">Answer Key:</strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h4 data-end=\"442\" data-start=\"414\"><strong data-end=\"442\" data-start=\"419\">Revocation Schemes:</strong></h4>\n\n<ol data-end=\"2831\" data-start=\"2257\">\n\t<li data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"444\">\n\t<p data-end=\"467\" data-start=\"447\"><strong data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"447\">Reacquisition:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"471\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"471\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"473\">Periodically delete capabilities so users must reacquire them to continue access.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"560\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"562\"><em data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"562\">Example:</em> Temporary conference room access cards that expire daily.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"632\">\n\t<p data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"635\"><strong data-end=\"653\" data-start=\"635\">Back-pointers:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"659\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"659\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"661\">Maintain a list of all capabilities pointing to an object; revoke by deleting entries via pointers.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"766\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"768\"><em data-end=\"778\" data-start=\"768\">Example:</em> If a file access is revoked, all users with pointers to it lose access immediately.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1067\" data-start=\"864\">\n\t<p data-end=\"878\" data-start=\"867\"><strong data-end=\"876\" data-start=\"867\">Keys:</strong></p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"1067\" data-start=\"882\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"882\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"884\">Objects have master keys; changing the key invalidates all existing capabilities referencing it.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"1067\" data-start=\"986\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"1067\" data-start=\"988\"><em data-end=\"998\" data-start=\"988\">Example:</em> Changing encryption keys invalidates prior file access capabilities.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n",
